}

docs {
  # PUT /api/admin/prodi/:id
  
  Mengubah data program studi.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Description |
  |-----------|------|-------------|
  | id | UUID | ID prodi yang ingin diupdate |
  
  ## Request Body (semua field optional)
  
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | kode_prodi | string | Kode prodi baru (unique) |
  | nama_prodi | string | Nama program studi baru |
  | jenjang | enum | D3, S1, S2, S3 |
  
  ## Response Success (200)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Prodi berhasil diperbarui",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "kode_prodi": "212025",
      "nama_prodi": "Teknik Elektro (Updated)",
      "jenjang": "S1",
      "createdAt": "2025-01-08T00:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-01-08T01:00:00.000Z"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response Error (404)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Prodi tidak ditemukan"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response Error (409 - Conflict)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Kode prodi '212025' sudah terdaftar"
  }
  ```
}
